<title>CHINA: China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) mixed.</title>
<headline>China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) mixed.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the China Interbank Offered Rate (CHIBOR) for Monday issued by the official Xinhua news agency on behalf of the People's Bank of China, the central bank.</p>
<p>The figures represent weighted averages and not closing prices and are annual percentage rates.</p>
<p>		 1DAY   7DAY  20DAY  30DAY  60DAY  90DAY  120DAY</p>
<p> MONDAY     11.436 11.606 11.480 11.451 11.753 11.728 12.041</p>
<p> PREVIOUS   11.977 12.135   -    11.295 11.521 11.889 12.083</p>
<p>Turnover rose to 4.6 billion yuan from 3.6 billion yuan last Friday with the seven-day contract the most active.</p>
</text>
